# Cursor AI Rules for Mabar Repository
# See AGENTS.md for full operational constraints.

- The repository is 100% TypeScript (`.ts` / `.tsx`). Always write typed TypeScript code for both backend and mobile.
- NEVER push directly to `main` or `dev`.
- Always create a scoped feature branch from `dev` (`feat/mobile-...`, `feat/backend-...`, `fix/...`).
- Run backend verification (`npm run typecheck && npm test` in `./backend`) before committing.
- Run mobile verification (`npm run typecheck` in `./mobile`) before committing.
- Do NOT use hardcoded colors in React Native components; import `THEME` from `src/theme`.
- Never commit `.env` or API credentials.
